{"id":"6b58bdde69f23eaa","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-brendle.md","title":"Brendle's Consistency Theorem","display":"thm-brendle — Brendle's Consistency Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-brendle","aliases":["58-thm-brendle"],"display":"thm-brendle — Brendle's Consistency Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-brendle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-brendle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-brendle — Brendle's Consistency Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c576036cb4f9664\" href=\"?note=7c576036cb4f9664\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md\">../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak a,\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak a,\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate for a recursively axiomatized theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brendle}\\vdash \\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\to\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathfrak b&lt;\\mathfrak a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brendle}\\vdash \\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\to\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathfrak b&lt;\\mathfrak a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a relative-consistency statement separating the bounding number from the almost-disjointness number.</li>\n<li>It does not split an unrelated claim <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak b=\\mathfrak d\">\\(\\mathfrak b=\\mathfrak d\\)</span> from an unconstrained assertion that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak a=\\kappa^+\">\\(\\mathfrak a=\\kappa^+\\)</span> is forceable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md","status":"resolved","id":"7c576036cb4f9664","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-cardinal-invariants.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak a,\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brendle}\\vdash \\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\to\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathfrak b<\\mathfrak a)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak b=\\mathfrak d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak a=\\kappa^+","display":false}],"bytes":878,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4061","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-brendle.md|58-thm-brendle]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["7c576036cb4f9664"]}